  "hasDescription": [
    {
      "@id": "https://data.datatourisme.fr/e9e93cdd-cf3d-3e99-b141-caa3bb155156",
      "dc:description": {
        "de": [
          "Zusammenstellung von großen Marken für Ausrüstung, Textilien und Schuhe. Carré Golf ist auch ein Fitting-Zentrum, FlightScope-Analysegerät, Club-Werkstatt: Regripping, Reshafting, Lie and Loft. Werkstatt für Trolleys.\nLogoprodukte: Bälle, Polohemden, Handtücher, Ablösung Pitch?"
        ],
        "en": [
          "All major brands of equipment, textiles and footwear. Carré Golf is also a fitting center, FlightScope analyzer, club workshop: Regripping, reshafting, lie and loft. Cart workshop.\nLogo products: balls, polo shirts, towels, pitch relief ?"
        ],
        "it": [
          "Tutte le principali marche di attrezzature, tessuti e calzature. Carré Golf è anche un centro di fitting, analizzatore FlightScope, officina di bastoni: Regripping, reshafting, lie e loft. Officina per carrelli.\nProdotti con logo: palline, polo, asciugamani, pitch relief, ecc"
        ],
        "fr": [
          "Ensemble de grandes marques de matériel, de textile et de chaussures. Carré Golf c'est aussi un centre de fitting, analyseur FlightScope, atelier club : Regripping, reshafting, lie and loft. Atelier chariot. \nProduits logotés : balles, polos, serviettes, relève pitch …"
        ],
        "es": [
          "Todas las grandes marcas de material, textil y calzado. Carré Golf es también un centro de fitting, analizador FlightScope, taller de palos: Regripping, reshafting, lie y loft. Taller de carros.\nProductos con logotipo: bolas, polos, toallas, relieve de campo, etc"
        ],
        "nl": [
          "Alle grote merken uitrusting, textiel en schoeisel. Carré Golf is ook een fitting center, FlightScope analyser, clubworkshop: Regripping, reshafting, lie en loft. Trolley werkplaats.\nLogo producten: ballen, poloshirts, handdoeken, pitch relief, enz"
        ]
      },
      "@type": [
        "Description"
